{"title":"Prediction markets in everything","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/929243990/0/marginalrevolution~Prediction-markets-in-everything.html","date":1764013175000,"content":"<blockquote>\r\n<p>Prediction market Kalshi Inc. and sneaker marketplace StockX are offering a new way to bet on the resale prices of in-demand sneakers and collectibles such as Labubus and Pokémon cards.</p>\r\n<p>In a partnership <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bloomberg.com/news/terminal/T5ZB8COW0PA8\" target=\"_blank\">announced Wednesday</a>, Kalshi will use StockX data to create so-called event contracts tied to sneakers, trading cards and figurines. Users will be able to trade on outcomes such as whether an item will surpass a price threshold after release day, or predict the best-selling brands during a major shopping event like Black Friday.</p>\r\n<p>Products that will be listed include highly-anticipated drops of Jordan sneakers, Supreme hoodies and blind boxes that contain random Labubus.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-11-19/want-to-bet-on-prices-for-sneakers-and-labubus-now-there-s-a-way?sref=htOHjx5Y\" target=\"_blank\">more from Bloomberg</a>, via John De Palma.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/prediction-markets-in-everything.html\">Prediction markets in everything</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/929243990/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/929243990/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/929243990/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/929243990/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/929243990/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/929243990/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/prediction-markets-in-everything.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/prediction-markets-in-everything.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/prediction-markets-in-everything.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/prediction-markets-in-everything.html#comment-160988062\">In reply to Frank.   Brian Armstrong pulled a fast one on ...</a> <i>by The Original D</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/prediction-markets-in-everything.html#comment-160987969\">In reply to Gilligan.   Hanson's Prediction Markets are too ...</a> <i>by yo</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/prediction-markets-in-everything.html#comment-160987947\">Seems objectively bad for society</a> <i>by Andao</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/prediction-markets-in-everything.html#comment-160987942\">In reply to PaulD.   It is reassuring to remember that the ...</a> <i>by Etalon d'Silomar</i></li><li><a href=\"https://margina